ۭ","ditebarkan/terbuka","munasharatan",3984]],"t":"Bahkan setiap orang dari mereka ingin agar diberikan kepadanya lembaran-lembaran (kitab) yang terbuka."},{"n":53,"w":[["كَلَّا ۖ","sekali-kali tidak","kallā",346],["بَل","bahkan","bal",93],["لَّا","tidak","lā",4],["يَخَافُونَ","mereka takut","yakhāfūna",136],["ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ","hari akhirat","l-ākhirata",72]],"t":"Tidak! Sebenarnya mereka tidak takut kepada akhirat."},{"n":54,"w":[["كَلَّآ","sekali-kali tidak","kallā",346],["إِنَّهُۥ","sesungguhnya ia","innahu",5],["تَذْكِرَةٌۭ","peringatan/pelajaran","tadhkiratun",925]],"t":"Tidak! Sesungguhnya (Alquran) itu benar-benar suatu peringatan."},{"n":55,"w":[["فَمَن","maka barangsiapa","faman",12],["شَآءَ","dia menghendaki","shāa",54],["ذَكَرَهُۥ","dia mengingatnya","dhakarahu",130]],"t":"Maka barangsiapa menghendaki, tentu dia mengambil pelajaran darinya."},{"n":56,"w":[["وَمَا","dan tidak","wamā",2],["يَذْكُرُونَ","mereka mengingat","yadhkurūna",130],["إِلَّآ","kecuali","illā",15],["أَن","bahwa","an",17],["يَشَآءَ","menghendaki","yashāa",54],["ٱللَّهُ ۚ","Allah","l-lahu",1],["هُوَ","Dia","huwa",20],["أَهْلُ","berhak/patut","ahlu",91],["ٱلتَّقْوَىٰ","takwa/taat","l-taqwā",580],["وَأَهْلُ","dan berhak/patut","wa-ahlu",91],["ٱلْمَغْفِرَةِ","ampunan","l-maghfirati",390]],"t":"Dan mereka tidak akan mengambil pelajaran darinya (Alquran) kecuali (jika) Allah menghendakinya. Dialah Tuhan yang patut (kita) bertakwa kepada-Nya dan yang berhak memberi ampun."}]